      ],
      "content": "TL 10 NW                    ST MICHAEL           BLUEHOUSE HILL (off)                                                   (north west side) 9/265                                            Aisled barn at Maynes                                                  Farm, 30 metres NW of new                                                  farmhouse GV                                               II Aisled barn.  C16 or earlier.  C20 machine tile roof, half hipped on ends.  Weatherboarding.  Gabled projection on centre NW side. 5 timber frame bays.  Aisled construction is virtually intact. The principals have passing braces from the wall posts to the tie beams,  crossing horizontal ties from the wall posts to the principals.  Tie beams with long curved braces.  In the NW aisle 2 passing braces on the W side are missing.  All construction above the wall plates is C20. Listing NGR: TL1237008366"
    }
  ],
